<p><span>There are&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.ltcc.edu/admissions/financial-aid/scholarships.php">A NUMBER OF STUDENT SCHOLARSHIPS</a><span>&nbsp;that you can apply for each spring. Scholarships make it possible to earn money for college that does not ever need to be repaid. While some of LTCC's scholarships are competitive, there is a wide variety available you can apply for for free that are awarded based on all kinds of qualities and interests.</span></p>
